## Frozen contracts

- **MAL-01:** provenance/source/originality classification; no proprietary copying or parallel owner truth.
- **MAL-02:** device-neutral semantic inputs, deterministic logical timing, ephemeral MAL-local state/goals, pause/retry, accessibility-equivalent controls and deterministic receipts.
- **MAL-03:** original MAL-local traversal projections. Hidden or unauthorized passage state remains unresolved; traversal never mutates canonical Character, World/Scene, Inventory or Travel truth.
- **MAL-04:** original MAL-local interaction/simple-conflict/hazard/pickup-reference/objective projections. Hidden interaction state remains unresolved; canonical owner domains remain external.
- **MAL-05:** original MAL-local NPC/enemy behavior and tiny deterministic state machines. Hidden intent, awareness, target and pathing state remains unresolved; no autonomous canonical NPC/Character agency is created.
- **MAL-06:** original deterministic MAL-local Aniloop compositions for travel, repair, downtime, transition and spacewalk. Loop completion never commits canonical owner-domain truth.
- **MAL-07:** original deterministic GM composition recipes and reference-only bindings to completed GCL-01..12. Missing, hidden, unauthorized or unfinished GCL references remain unresolved. GCL remains canonical and no GCL discovery/recommendation or composition-engine authority is implemented.

## MAL-08 governed boundary

Owner reference kinds: `character-npc`, `world-scene`, `project-progression`, `action-event`, `inventory-asset`, `combat`, `travel`, `reward`, `permission`.

Handoff intents: `observe-owner-reference`, `propose-character-npc-effect`, `propose-world-scene-effect`, `propose-project-progression-effect`, `propose-action-event`, `propose-reward-request`.

Handoff states: `reference-linked-local`, `proposal-prepared-local`, `owner-handoff-ready-local`, `blocked-local`, `unresolved`.

Reward boundary states: `not-requested`, `proposal-only`, `owner-authorization-required`, `owner-acknowledged-reference`, `owner-rejected-reference`, `unresolved`.

Unknown, hidden or unauthorized owner-domain state remains `unresolved`. MAL-08 never invents owner acknowledgements, commits owner outcomes, mutates canonical state or grants/transfers/creates/equips/consumes rewards. AI remains proposal-only.

The same authorized references, MAL-local state and logical tick must produce the same local handoff state and deterministic receipt. Wall-clock time, frame timing, device identity, network timing and nondeterministic randomness are not outcome truth.

MAL-07 GCL integration remains frozen. No unfinished GCL authority, GCL discovery/recommendation or GCL composition-engine behavior is added.

No durable persistence, migration `0022`, MAL-09+, ALP-01+, provider activation, tester distribution, release or deployment is authorized.

